title: OPNsense: Temperature
agents: opnsense
catalog: hw
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk

description:
 This check monitors a temperature sensor (CPU cores, ACPI zones) of an
 OPNsense firewall. The data is collected via the special agent
 {agent_opnsense} from the {diagnostics/system/system_temperature} endpoint.

 Default levels are 70 / 80 °C and can be set through the rule "OPNsense
 temperature sensors". Virtual machines usually expose no sensors, in which
 case no services are discovered.

item:
 The sensor type and number, for example {CPU 0}.

discovery:
 One service {OPNsense Temperature SENSOR} is created for each sensor.
